  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stop Djekoidjo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the activity is to increase the coverage and use of life-saving malaria interventions in line with national malaria control strategy. The activity will also complement maternal, neonatal and child health (MNCH), reproductive health and family planning (RH/FP) interventions and contribute significantly to the delivery of a comprehensive package of primary health care services to remote and underserved populations as the malaria in-pregnancy component will be part of the integrated activity.</narrative>
  </description>
